  "description": "“Is there no place where a man can let out cries like a woman in ecstasy?”\n\nBecause of his family’s circumstances, Yeon-hu moves with his father to a rural village. Tricked by his older brother, he visits a courtesan house for the first time, where his delicate looks draw teasing and attention. It’s there he hears whispers about Do-hyeon, the village’s infamous “man-lover,” a notorious libertine. Yeon-hu never imagined such rumors would have anything to do with him—until Do-hyeon himself appears before him!\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000061456)",
